# DECISIONS — Design record (ADR-lite)

Record every harness-document, structure, and evaluator change here. A change without evidence has no reliable rollback point.

## Format

```
## D-00N — <title> (<date>)
- Decision: <what changed>
- Evidence: <why; cite journal events, interview answers, or evaluation reports>
- Impact: <files and policies changed>
```

---

> In `create` mode, render D-001 below. In `improve|reconcile`, preserve D-001 and all history, then append the next decision number. Never overwrite an existing file with this template.

## D-001 — Initial harness configuration ({{CREATED_DATE}})

- Decision: Scaffold the harness with Harness Factory. Design direction = {{DESIGN_ORIENTATION}}. Record evidence for any override from the default.
- Evidence: Interview result — {{INTERVIEW_SUMMARY}}
  <!-- Record Q1-Q4 answers and every applied default. -->
- Impact: In create mode, initialize managed files under {{HARNESS_ROOT}}. Primary evaluator = {{EVALUATOR_PRIMARY}}, budget policy = {{BUDGET_POLICY}}, operation mode = {{OPERATION_MODE}}.
- Verification and repair rounds (maximum 3):
  - Round 1: {{VERIFY_ROUND_1}} <!-- Record failures and repairs; use "all checks passed" only when true. -->
  - Round 2: <!-- Record results, or "not run". -->
  - Round 3: <!-- Record results; include remaining failures in the delivery report. -->

## Append for improve or reconcile

- Mode and change ID
- Original validator and evaluator baseline
- File ownership and `maintenance/runs/<change-id>/preservation-before.json`
- Classifications, conflicts, and approvals from `delta-plan.json`
- `preservation-after.json` comparison and task/harness evaluation results
